+#
+# =====================================================================
+# CUSTOM SPELL - Storm Shackle (stormshackle) - WRV-070, Oct 17, 2026
+# =====================================================================
+# Mike's design: "a chain lightning that does VERY LOW damage but SLOWS
+# the enemies it arcs to." Built from Magic 11.2.5's chainlightning
+# block (copied structure and effects), with these deliberate changes:
+#
+#   DAMAGE: every Damage action uses player_damage 0.5 / entity_damage
+#     0.5 (chainlightning ships 1.5 / 2, plus a 0.5 / 1 repeat tick).
+#     0.5 is the smallest damage value the shipped defaults themselves
+#     use for a damage tick = a quarter-heart per strike. The `repeat`
+#     parameter drops 4 -> 2, halving the repeat ticks. Worst case per
+#     enemy is ~2 HP (one heart) if it eats every branch; a typical
+#     single arc hit is 0.5-1 HP. This is a control spell, not a weapon.
+#   SLOW: a PotionEffect action rides next to EVERY Damage action, so
+#     each struck enemy is slowed. Format is Magic's own (verified
+#     against the shipped defaults - frost and curse use the same
+#     mechanism, and against the 11.2.5 bytecode): a bare PotionEffect
+#     action reads `effect_<name>` + `duration` from its parameters.
+#     Here, action-local parameters set:
+#       effect_slow: 0   -> Slowness amplifier 0 = Slowness I
+#       duration: 4000   -> 4000 ms = 4 seconds
+#   COST: mana 50 (heal-tier; chainlightning ships 75), cooldown
+#     10000 ms (half of chainlightning's 20000; in family with the
+#     Phase 1 support spells). Not free, not spammable.
+#   No upgrade variants (|2/|3) and no upgrade_required_*: Phase 1
+#     ships exactly this one level, target_count stays 3 (the raw
+#     spell's apprentice/master variants raise it to 5/8 - Phase 2
+#     territory, not ours).
+#   category: utility (control/support, not combat). icon reuses the
+#     chainlightning icon, which still resolves from default icons.
+#   Display name/description live in this packet's messages.yml.
+#
+stormshackle:
+  # WRV balance/Bedrock proposal Oct 23 2026 (staged only, not live)
+  icon: chainlightning
+  category: utility
+  worth: 1260
+  earns: 6
